#: crates/app/src/about.rs:20
msgid ""
"Installs and runs DaVinci Resolve on any Linux distribution, in an isolated "
"container, and converts media Resolve can't open on Linux."
msgstr ""
"Instala e executa o DaVinci Resolve em qualquer distribuição Linux, num "
"container isolado, e converte as mídias que o Resolve não abre no Linux."

#: crates/app/src/about.rs:30
msgid "Unofficial"
msgstr "Não oficial"

#: crates/app/src/about.rs:33
msgid ""
"Vinci is an independent project, not affiliated with Blackmagic Design. "
"DaVinci Resolve is a trademark of Blackmagic Design Pty. Ltd. and is "
"downloaded from its website under its own license."
msgstr ""
"O Vinci é um projeto independente, sem afiliação com a Blackmagic Design. "
"DaVinci Resolve é marca registrada da Blackmagic Design Pty. Ltd. e é "
"baixado do site dela, sob a licença dela."

